{
  "version": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "System 層：身份、NC4 通道與解碼路線。",
    "這塊白牌 S3 板有 USB OTG（TinyUSB MSC+CDC）＋ UART；USB OTG 與 USJ 共用 PHY，所以 console=none。",
    "完整說明：docs/03_notes/config-layers.md、docs/03_notes/routing.md",
    "USB：hardware phy=otg-fs（GPIO19/20）；目標 link {kind:\"usb\",index:0,msc:1}。現時 interim kind:\"cdc\",usb:0。",
    "links[].name：可省略或用 \"name\":\"\" → 自動生成；有非空 name 就用。links[].msc：USB link 的 MSC 開關（只 OTG）。"
  ],
  "cID": "",
  "frame_interval_ms": 20,
  "num_pixels": 0,
  "usb": {
    "cdc_log": 1
  },
  "log_debug_mode": 0,
  "nc4": {
    "links": [
      {
        "name": "usb0",
        "kind": "usb",
        "index": 0,
        "msc": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "uart0",
        "kind": "uart",
        "index": 0
      }
    ],
    "routes": [
      {
        "in": "nctx",
        "out": [
          "decode0"
        ]
      },
      {
        "in": "outbound",
        "out": []
      },
      {
        "in": "usb0",
        "out": [
          "decode0"
        ]
      },
      {
        "in": "uart0",
        "out": [
          "decode1"
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
